<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone attacks linked to Ethiopia killed four people and damaged a United Nations building in Khartoum, while artillery shelling in Alamata killed 14 civilians. Ethiopia has offered to host comprehensive Sudanese dialogue and Abiy Ahmed has called for Sudanese parties to join a mediation table, while leaked intelligence suggests Eritrean and Sudanese coordination of drone strikes on Mekelle and Assosa. Ethiopian forces have regained control of border areas near Badme, and fighting along the Afar-Somali border continues over territorial disputes, drought and resource scarcity. Amnesty International has called for a probe into possible war crimes in Tigray, and 2,824 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPeUhJdlpRZG5aSUZHX3V2YWJqUXBNSFdpZXdtamZnaXdtcDB1SjdtQzlIVzNsOUxtWmdYOTh2S0lWSU16anZhSnhvcmdZSzJwSTM5b1lMSWJneng1dlVPNVRuLUliTWN5QVYxdXpuT0xUM1p1TGZUU3VKdzJybzRGbzdfbWhkWnFHZUpyOWlBd1R6ZE5WMFlIZUdZSlpWd3lXaW9IWEllUkdCZlh2YVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQSV9FZG5DNHVMb2VPcUNIVFBWRzdtY2Zaa0N3THFKTEJ3NnU5aVdHbHJ3WjRmSlFBdXBVZXFodkViSW1sVVM5d0FyLWFKZFFhODBESm5HUEFOUDUzTFUwU3RHcFZFYnl2Zm90RzV5dmpPQjlwSGNHVmJ3bjJwSTdWMDBKemFrU0FMZTdFaGN3aHFzNlNqU0t4NUhpRFVzSEZpWVR6TWxR?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQTGNVLXF1UDdNZVUyZk1NNFJYdmNwMXgydEhVWUluYml4SlJuMjBRQVJ5N3RnRzZleTdITDNXNjRpQ2pTX2Z4X2J3ZmZPWGd4WTFUdkJCS19VS1VXR2NCS1NONXJETmFJYU55MXprSjVRNk5EUDFsTTJDdVY3ZWRUSlNOeEhtTURVWDAzMGNDdVJBRGNYd3JjR0FlcE1vQ0ZFcmdDSUxfbG95Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBM